This derivative adds one Sol chief over three bounded Sol/Luna sets,
Fast requirements for every model role, global dispatch ownership,
work-key and path conflict validation, capacity grants, and acknowledged
handoffs. The public package adds Korean/English documentation, portable
ownership tests, an example dispatch plan, and original explanatory diagrams.

The sun, crescent and star glyphs were originally created for the
6-1-sol-orch distribution in 2026. They are not official model logos.
Their source notes and hashes are retained in the asset manifest.

